eliverables written to `out/`:\n\n- `out/module_map.json`\n- `out/architecture.md`\n- `out/doc_code_discrepancies.csv`\n- `out/risk_register.csv`\n- `out/onboarding_plan.md`\n\nChecks:\n- `module_map.json` parsed as JSON.\n- Required keys present: `modules`, `entry_points`, `dependency_edges`, `key_functions`, `runtime_flows`.\n- Required entry points present: `minisvc.cli:main`, `minisvc.api.routes:register_routes`.\n- Discrepancy CSV covers readonly enforcement, retry behavior, and audit persistence.\n- Risk register covers storage/data durability, audit behavior, configuration/runtime environment, and API input validation.\n\nRuntime evidence used:\n- CLI entry function: `python3 -c \"from minisvc.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\"` → printed `minisvc ready at orders.sqlite`.\n- Exercised create/read flow against a temporary SQLite DB:\n  - `create_order(...)` returned `status='created'`\n  - `get_order('o-1', ...)` returned `status='ok'`\n  - missing lookup returned `status='missing'`\n- Verified doc drift:\n  - `MINISVC_READONLY=1` is parsed but not enforced; create still persisted a row.\n  - SQLite schema after create flow contained only `orders`; no audit table.\n\nI did not modify anything under `in/repo`.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_03f8569485436378016a9583d2976887d2acd7900cd3fa978e\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1671,"output":367,"cacheRead":33280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35318,"reasoningTokens":61,"cost":{"input":0.004177500000000001,"output":0.005505,"cacheRead":0.00832,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.018002499999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788183503424,"responseId":"resp_03f8569485436378016a9583cfbdd887d296471faab88e7003","duration":8762.588701,"ttft":2071.7313160000194}],"isTerminal":true}
